- Access ACL: `user::rwx`, `user:alice:rwx`, `user:bob:rwx`, `group::rwx`, `group:research:rwx`, `mask::rwx`, `other::---`.
- Default ACL: identical entries, including `default:mask::rwx` (this is the piece that keeps named-user entries unmasked when members use a restrictive umask).
